tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560260/extras/8b92354e8947519d35516d737dd271d7.poster.avif?t=1622212548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560260/extras/8b92354e8947519d35516d737dd271d7.webm?t=1622212548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1560260/extras/8b92354e8947519d35516d737dd271d7.mp4?t=1622212548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
